1
00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:33,000
Mother...!

2
00:01:37,000 --> 00:01:40,000
Mother...!

3
00:01:46,000 --> 00:01:47,800
Help...!

4
00:02:58,000 --> 00:02:59,800
Help!

5
00:03:22,600 --> 00:03:24,600
Are you all right, Jiujin?

6
00:03:24,600 --> 00:03:27,000
Yes. This uncle saved me

7
00:03:29,000 --> 00:03:31,000
Thank you for saving Jiujin

8
00:03:31,000 --> 00:03:36,000
Don't mention it. I should thank you
for sparing my life the other day

9
00:03:36,000 --> 00:03:38,000
Think nothing of it

10
00:03:39,800 --> 00:03:41,800
Get out of here now!

11
00:03:42,000 --> 00:03:45,800
You're injured. You go with Jiujin.
I'll cover you

12
00:03:48,000 --> 00:03:49,000
Take care

13
00:03:51,000 --> 00:03:52,400
You too

14
00:04:12,000 --> 00:04:14,000
Shou, what's that?

15
00:04:14,000 --> 00:04:16,000
Why did you bring this monster back?

16
00:04:16,600 --> 00:04:21,600
I didn't. The Deity of Plague sent it
to wreak havoc. We must get rid of it!

17
00:04:21,600 --> 00:04:22,600
Run!

18
00:05:26,000 --> 00:05:27,400
Shou!

19
00:05:36,000 --> 00:05:38,000
I'll die together with you!

20
00:05:38,000 --> 00:05:40,600
No, Shou!

21
00:05:48,000 --> 00:05:50,000
Shou!

22
00:06:07,800 --> 00:06:10,000
Shou...!

23
00:06:10,600 --> 00:06:12,600
Are you all right?

24
00:06:18,000 --> 00:06:20,600
Shou!

25
00:06:23,000 --> 00:06:27,000
Wake up, Shou...!

26
00:06:28,000 --> 00:06:31,000
Uncle, wake up...!

27
00:06:31,000 --> 00:06:33,000
What happened?

28
00:06:33,000 --> 00:06:37,000
Sorry, Auntie. He got injured
while trying to save us

29
00:06:38,000 --> 00:06:42,000
Don't be upset.
Shou will be all right

30
00:06:42,800 --> 00:06:46,800
That's right. He'll pull through
since he's such a kindhearted man

31
00:06:47,000 --> 00:06:50,000
We must get him the best doctor!

32
00:06:50,000 --> 00:06:56,600
He is the best doctor, but he's now
in a coma. Who else can save him?

33
00:06:57,000 --> 00:07:00,000
To think my son will be gone
before me...!

34
00:07:02,000 --> 00:07:06,000
-Uncle...!
-Wake up, Shou...!

35
00:07:06,000 --> 00:07:10,000
Shou did everything for us

36
00:07:11,000 --> 00:07:17,000
He's not 30 yet. If he's gone now, he
won't live up to his name as Longevity

37
00:07:17,000 --> 00:07:21,000
Wake up, Shou...!

38
00:07:25,000 --> 00:07:30,000
There's a drought. We don't have
any more water to brew medicine for Shou

39
00:07:38,000 --> 00:07:40,000
The Deity of Plague is to blame!

40
00:07:41,000 --> 00:07:44,600
Shou is dying.
What are we going to do?

41
00:07:46,000 --> 00:07:50,000
If we can make boundless good fortune
and longevity happen,

42
00:07:50,000 --> 00:07:53,600
miracles will happen
and Shou will be saved

43
00:07:55,000 --> 00:08:00,000
That's impossible.
Do you know the Eastern Sea?

44
00:08:00,000 --> 00:08:05,000
Its waves surge for 300 years
and recede for another 300 years

45
00:08:05,000 --> 00:08:07,600
We can't possibly go against Nature

46
00:08:08,000 --> 00:08:12,000
Besides, we don't know what longevity
comparable to the mountains means

47
00:08:14,000 --> 00:08:20,000
Are we just going to let Shou pass on
without doing anything then?

48
00:08:22,000 --> 00:08:25,600
If he's fated to pass on,
there's nothing we can do

49
00:08:29,000 --> 00:08:34,600
We can only pray to Heaven
to bring us rain...

50
00:08:35,000 --> 00:08:37,600
so we can get out of
the spell of drought

51
00:08:38,000 --> 00:08:41,600
That's easy to say.
How do we pray for rain?

52
00:08:41,600 --> 00:08:47,000
The reverend once told me
when one is in trouble,

53
00:08:47,000 --> 00:08:51,000
one will be saved if one prays
to the Goddess of Mercy sincerely

54
00:08:53,000 --> 00:08:55,000
Let's pray to Her!

55
00:08:56,000 --> 00:09:01,000
That's the only way out.
We'll get everybody to pray with us!

56
00:09:18,000 --> 00:09:20,600
Uncle has come to, Granny!

57
00:09:21,000 --> 00:09:23,000
Shou, you've come to!

58
00:09:24,000 --> 00:09:26,800
Shou...!

59
00:09:27,000 --> 00:09:29,000
Uncle!

60
00:09:33,000 --> 00:09:36,000
Heaven, I'm going to
give the people...

61
00:09:36,000 --> 00:09:40,000
all the good fortune I've accumulated
over the years by doing good deeds

62
00:09:41,000 --> 00:09:45,600
I'd rather let the people have it
than become an immortal myself

63
00:09:46,000 --> 00:09:49,000
Please rain to save the people!

64
00:10:15,000 --> 00:10:16,400
Look!

65
00:10:21,800 --> 00:10:22,800
Lu!

66
00:10:33,000 --> 00:10:35,000
Great! It's raining!

67
00:10:36,000 --> 00:10:38,000
We did it!

68
00:10:39,000 --> 00:10:41,000
It's raining!

69
00:10:45,000 --> 00:10:50,000
Look!
Shou has come round!

70
00:10:50,000 --> 00:10:53,000
Shou has come round!

71
00:10:54,000 --> 00:10:59,000
Shou! We did it!
We succeeded in pleading for rain!

72
00:10:59,600 --> 00:11:00,600
Look!

73
00:11:05,000 --> 00:11:07,000
Hang on!

74
00:11:08,000 --> 00:11:11,000
Do you call this
boundless good fortune?

75
00:11:11,000 --> 00:11:13,000
What makes you say that?

76
00:11:13,000 --> 00:11:17,000
You threw many characters of
"fortune" into the air just now

77
00:11:17,000 --> 00:11:20,600
When they came down,
they covered the earth

78
00:11:20,600 --> 00:11:24,000
Didn't that look like
boundless good fortune?

79
00:11:24,000 --> 00:11:25,000
That's right!

80
00:11:27,000 --> 00:11:29,000
Shou has passed out again!

81
00:11:47,000 --> 00:11:50,000
Must we make longevity comparable to
the mountains happen too?

82
00:11:50,000 --> 00:11:54,000
Are we to move to the mountains
to save Shou?

83
00:11:54,000 --> 00:11:56,000
Let's just try!

84
00:12:17,800 --> 00:12:18,800
Halt!

85
00:12:32,800 --> 00:12:37,600
Let's hope Shou will come to
quickly and live on

86
00:12:38,000 --> 00:12:43,000
He sacrificed himself to save us.
We should give him our lives

87
00:12:54,600 --> 00:12:56,000
Shou...

88
00:12:57,000 --> 00:12:59,000
Easy...

89
00:13:05,000 --> 00:13:08,000
Shou!

90
00:13:10,000 --> 00:13:11,600
Shou!

91
00:13:13,000 --> 00:13:15,000
Wake up, Shou!

92
00:13:18,000 --> 00:13:22,000
Wake up, Shou...!

93
00:13:30,000 --> 00:13:32,000
Wake up, Uncle!

94
00:13:34,000 --> 00:13:36,000
Uncle has come to!

95
00:13:36,600 --> 00:13:37,600
Uncle!

96
00:13:41,000 --> 00:13:44,000
I'm all right!

97
00:13:44,000 --> 00:13:45,600
Look!

98
00:13:47,000 --> 00:13:49,000
"Longevity"?
Shou!

99
00:13:49,000 --> 00:13:52,600
This is longevity comparable
to the mountains!

100
00:13:58,000 --> 00:14:00,000
We've made it happen!

101
00:14:00,000 --> 00:14:03,000
Good fortune
as boundless as the seas,

102
00:14:03,000 --> 00:14:06,000
and longevity comparable to
the mountains!

103
00:14:15,000 --> 00:14:17,000
Don't make me worry in future, son

104
00:14:19,000 --> 00:14:24,000
We've made the phenomena happen and
there's peace and harmony everywhere

105
00:14:24,000 --> 00:14:27,000
I've become more and more
confident of myself

106
00:14:27,000 --> 00:14:30,000
I doubt there's anything
I can't do

107
00:14:31,000 --> 00:14:34,800
It's important to be confident

108
00:14:42,000 --> 00:14:44,400
What's going on?
Don't be afraid!

109
00:14:46,000 --> 00:14:48,600
Granny, the Spider Spirit
is here again!

110
00:14:49,000 --> 00:14:51,000
Don't panic.
It's the Deity of Plague

111
00:14:51,000 --> 00:14:53,000
Brother-in-law, protect Mother!

112
00:14:53,000 --> 00:14:56,000
Mother, go home quickly!
Datou, protect them!

113
00:14:57,000 --> 00:14:59,000
Be careful!

114
00:15:05,000 --> 00:15:08,000
Come out, Deity of Plague!

115
00:15:13,600 --> 00:15:15,000
It's Zhang Guolao!

116
00:15:15,000 --> 00:15:20,000
Relax. The Jade Emperor
has learnt all about it

117
00:15:21,000 --> 00:15:26,000
Since you've made
the phenomena happen,

118
00:15:27,000 --> 00:15:31,000
please stretch out your hands
and join them,

119
00:15:32,000 --> 00:15:34,000
and see what happens

120
00:15:41,000 --> 00:15:46,000
That's right. Put your hands together
and golden lights will shine

121
00:15:46,000 --> 00:15:52,600
You've re-attained immortality

122
00:15:53,000 --> 00:15:55,000
Come with me

123
00:15:56,000 --> 00:15:58,000
We can't!

124
00:15:58,000 --> 00:16:01,000
We still have important things to do

125
00:16:01,000 --> 00:16:04,600
That's right. We aren't ready
to see the Jade Emperor yet

126
00:16:05,000 --> 00:16:07,000
You're weird, Longevity

127
00:16:07,000 --> 00:16:12,600
I understand they can't bear to part
with Princess Ruining and Yu Shuangxi

128
00:16:13,000 --> 00:16:18,000
But if you go to Heaven, you'll be
able to see Ma-gu. You should be happy

129
00:16:18,000 --> 00:16:22,000
It has nothing to do with her.
We haven't got rid of the Deity of Plague

130
00:16:22,000 --> 00:16:27,600
He'll continue to wreak havoc. We must
remove him before we return to Heaven

131
00:16:28,000 --> 00:16:32,600
That's right.
We'd have lived in vain otherwise

132
00:16:33,000 --> 00:16:37,000
Please let the Jade Emperor know
we must destroy the Deity of Plague...

133
00:16:37,000 --> 00:16:39,000
or we'll be letting the mortals down

134
00:16:40,000 --> 00:16:43,000
We'll present the head of the Deity
of Plague to the Jade Emperor!

135
00:16:43,000 --> 00:16:44,000
Right!

136
00:16:44,000 --> 00:16:49,600
All right, quickly subdue
the Deity of Plague

137
00:16:50,000 --> 00:16:56,400
Only when you've done that will
the mortal world enjoy good fortune

138
00:16:57,000 --> 00:17:02,600
I wish you success.
Goodbye

139
00:17:03,000 --> 00:17:05,000
See you!

140
00:17:07,600 --> 00:17:13,600
Let's look for the Deity of Plague now.
We'll save the people from disasters!

141
00:17:29,000 --> 00:17:33,000
This place has an aura of evil.
He must be hiding here

142
00:17:33,000 --> 00:17:36,800
Why does he keep making trouble
in the mortal world?

143
00:17:37,000 --> 00:17:42,000
Unless there's no more greed,
anger and infatuation in men,

144
00:17:42,000 --> 00:17:45,000
he'll always get a chance
to wreak havoc

145
00:17:45,800 --> 00:17:50,000
We must get rid of him so he won't
be able to do evil anymore!

146
00:17:50,000 --> 00:17:51,000
Right!

147
00:19:20,000 --> 00:19:23,000
Shou, Lu, how are you?

148
00:19:24,000 --> 00:19:26,000
It's so hot!

149
00:19:27,000 --> 00:19:29,000
It's hot, Lu!

150
00:19:31,000 --> 00:19:33,000
Why is my bum so hot?

151
00:19:33,000 --> 00:19:36,000
Can't you see we're
surrounded by fire?

152
00:19:46,000 --> 00:19:49,000
We meet again, Three Stars!

153
00:19:49,800 --> 00:19:51,800
What do you want?

154
00:19:52,000 --> 00:19:55,000
Why is there a ring of fire?

155
00:19:55,000 --> 00:19:57,800
What do you want, you evil thing?!

156
00:20:00,000 --> 00:20:03,000
Why is there a cauldron here?

157
00:20:03,000 --> 00:20:06,000
You can't make pills out of us!

158
00:20:06,800 --> 00:20:08,800
I hate you!

159
00:20:09,000 --> 00:20:13,000
I'm going to eat you up
to appease my hatred

160
00:20:14,000 --> 00:20:17,600
And after eating you,
I'll enjoy longevity!

161
00:20:19,800 --> 00:20:24,800
After doing so much evil,
you still want to eat us! You rat!

162
00:20:25,000 --> 00:20:28,000
There's the dark side of men

163
00:20:28,000 --> 00:20:32,600
If you're always good to them,
they'll tend to do wicked things

164
00:20:33,000 --> 00:20:35,800
My duty is to punish them

165
00:20:36,000 --> 00:20:42,600
I'm the only one who can make them
tell good from bad

166
00:20:42,600 --> 00:20:48,600
What nonsense! You deserve death for
claiming many lives in an epidermic

167
00:20:48,600 --> 00:20:50,600
Eating us won't help!

168
00:20:51,000 --> 00:20:55,600
I deserve death?
You ought to worry about yourselves

169
00:20:56,000 --> 00:21:01,000
You'll see how I eat you up!

170
00:21:04,000 --> 00:21:08,000
After eating you,
my life will be as long as Heaven's

171
00:21:09,000 --> 00:21:13,000
I'll become the supreme ruler
both in Heaven and on earth!

172
00:21:15,000 --> 00:21:20,000
Fu, I don't want to
turn into charcoal!

173
00:21:20,000 --> 00:21:24,000
Quick, think of a way out, Lu!

174
00:21:24,000 --> 00:21:27,600
Be quiet!
I'm racking my brains!

175
00:21:35,000 --> 00:21:37,000
It's so hot...!

176
00:22:14,000 --> 00:22:16,000
Why did the fire go out?

177
00:22:43,000 --> 00:22:49,600
We'll give you a chance to repent.
Come with us to see the Jade Emperor

178
00:22:50,000 --> 00:22:52,600
You can't get away.
Surrender yourself!

179
00:22:54,000 --> 00:22:55,600
Never!

180
00:22:55,600 --> 00:22:58,600
In that case, meet your doom!

181
00:22:59,000 --> 00:23:03,000
It's still not known
who'll have the last laugh!

182
00:26:26,000 --> 00:26:28,600
Let me out...!

183
00:26:32,800 --> 00:26:35,600
Look what this is

184
00:26:38,000 --> 00:26:41,600
Aren't you ruthless
to turn me into a tortoise!

185
00:26:42,000 --> 00:26:45,000
You really are the Deity of Plague?

186
00:26:45,000 --> 00:26:47,000
You think I'm joking with you?

187
00:26:49,000 --> 00:26:53,000
Great. Now that you can only crawl,
you won't be able to do any evil

188
00:26:54,000 --> 00:26:56,000
That's so unhygienic!

189
00:26:59,000 --> 00:27:02,000
Oh, aren't you adorable!

190
00:27:02,000 --> 00:27:08,000
It's better for you to be a tortoise
than the Deity of Plague

191
00:27:08,000 --> 00:27:14,000
Now you can amuse people, and after
your death, you can be used as medicine

192
00:27:18,000 --> 00:27:23,000
Congratulations!
You've become immortals again!

193
00:27:38,000 --> 00:27:41,000
Congratulations!

194
00:27:43,000 --> 00:27:45,000
What are we hugging each other for?

195
00:27:45,000 --> 00:27:48,000
-You know, I'm rather angry
-Why? This is a happy occasion

196
00:27:48,000 --> 00:27:52,800
You actually couldn't recognize me
at the Eastern Sea then. You rascals!

197
00:27:53,000 --> 00:27:55,000
What's the big deal?

198
00:27:55,000 --> 00:28:00,000
Well, since we were rascals,
we couldn't possibly remember you

199
00:28:00,000 --> 00:28:01,000
Well said

200
00:28:01,000 --> 00:28:05,000
Zhang Guolao,
you're indeed a friend

201
00:28:05,000 --> 00:28:09,000
Not only did you enter my dream,
you even appeared to help us

202
00:28:09,000 --> 00:28:12,000
I'm so touched!

203
00:28:14,000 --> 00:28:19,000
What I did was nothing
compared to your confidante

204
00:28:24,000 --> 00:28:26,000
How is she?

205
00:28:38,600 --> 00:28:41,600
Our respects to Jade Emperor
and Queen Mother

206
00:28:42,000 --> 00:28:48,000
Having gone through the mill,
do you think you've grown in age...

207
00:28:48,000 --> 00:28:51,000
as well as wisdom?

208
00:28:55,000 --> 00:28:57,000
Thank you for your praises

209
00:28:57,000 --> 00:29:02,000
Indeed the three disasters
and nine tribulations...

210
00:29:02,000 --> 00:29:05,000
were quite an experience to us

211
00:29:05,000 --> 00:29:08,000
We'll always bear them in mind

212
00:29:09,000 --> 00:29:12,000
One who has never suffered
isn't a hero

213
00:29:13,000 --> 00:29:16,600
It's good that you've all
become heroes

214
00:29:19,000 --> 00:29:23,000
Though you were only in the
mortal world for a short period,

215
00:29:23,000 --> 00:29:29,000
you mended your ways, cultivated
your mind, fought against plague,

216
00:29:29,000 --> 00:29:32,600
and helped the people of Ping'an Town

217
00:29:35,000 --> 00:29:38,000
Not only that,
you exposed a conspiracy,

218
00:29:38,000 --> 00:29:44,600
defeated the Deity of Plague
and got rid of the Spider Spirit

219
00:29:45,000 --> 00:29:47,000
You've rendered great service

220
00:29:47,000 --> 00:29:50,000
Thank you for your praises

221
00:29:50,000 --> 00:29:56,000
Make your request. So long as
it's reasonable, I'll grant you

222
00:29:57,000 --> 00:30:01,000
Please release Ma-gu

223
00:30:05,000 --> 00:30:07,000
Just as I expected

224
00:30:08,000 --> 00:30:13,000
So do you think their request
is a reasonable one?

225
00:30:14,000 --> 00:30:18,000
Ma-gu did what she did
out of affection

226
00:30:18,000 --> 00:30:19,000
Indeed

227
00:30:19,000 --> 00:30:22,600
She was a great help to the Trio

228
00:30:23,000 --> 00:30:26,000
It wasn't easy for a woman
to do all that at all

229
00:30:26,000 --> 00:30:31,000
She sacrificed herself to help
her friends in times of need

230
00:30:31,000 --> 00:30:33,000
I'm so touched!

231
00:30:34,600 --> 00:30:39,600
Everybody is talking about
her noble act

232
00:30:40,000 --> 00:30:44,000
Good news never goes beyond the gate
while bad news spreads a thousand li away

233
00:30:45,000 --> 00:30:49,000
Please let her off

234
00:30:51,800 --> 00:30:53,800
Please be merciful!

235
00:30:56,000 --> 00:30:58,600
Please be merciful!

236
00:30:59,000 --> 00:31:03,000
I never said I'd lock her up forever

237
00:31:05,600 --> 00:31:11,000
Frankly, I really miss the wine
she brews sometimes

238
00:31:11,000 --> 00:31:13,600
Thank you!

239
00:31:14,000 --> 00:31:15,600
Get up

240
00:31:19,000 --> 00:31:22,000
All right, I'll release Ma-gu

241
00:31:22,000 --> 00:31:28,000
But I forbid you to see her
in the Celestial Court again

242
00:31:28,000 --> 00:31:30,000
-Why?
-No idea

243
00:31:31,000 --> 00:31:33,000
Why can't I see her again?

244
00:31:56,000 --> 00:31:58,000
Ma-gu, I've come!

245
00:31:59,000 --> 00:32:02,000
Congratulations!
You've been released!

246
00:32:03,000 --> 00:32:05,000
How come it's you?

247
00:32:05,000 --> 00:32:09,000
I came to tell you the good news.
Let's go

248
00:32:09,000 --> 00:32:11,000
The Three Stars are back?

249
00:32:12,000 --> 00:32:13,000
Yes

250
00:32:13,000 --> 00:32:16,600
-How are they?
-They're perfectly fine

251
00:32:17,000 --> 00:32:21,000
The Queen Mother even said
they looked more charming...

252
00:32:21,000 --> 00:32:23,000
after their trip to the mortal world

253
00:32:23,000 --> 00:32:25,000
-You're lying
-I'm lying?

254
00:32:25,000 --> 00:32:29,800
If everything was well,
why didn't he come?

255
00:32:34,000 --> 00:32:39,000
Trust you to hem and haw
when I need to know something

256
00:32:39,000 --> 00:32:41,000
I'll go and find out from
the Jade Emperor

257
00:32:41,000 --> 00:32:43,000
Don't be rash

258
00:32:46,000 --> 00:32:51,000
The Jade Emperor forbids you
to see each other again

259
00:33:25,000 --> 00:33:30,600
Please let Fu come back soon.
I miss him so much...

260
00:33:30,600 --> 00:33:36,000
Thinking of Fu again? The Three Stars
grant every wish we make

261
00:33:36,000 --> 00:33:38,000
Fu will come back for sure

262
00:33:38,600 --> 00:33:43,600
Mother, everybody is saying
the Longevity Star is actually Shou

263
00:33:44,000 --> 00:33:48,000
I don't want him to be an immortal.
I just want him by my side

264
00:33:48,000 --> 00:33:51,600
Please see that he comes back soon

265
00:33:53,000 --> 00:33:56,600
Your Highness, the Three Star Temple
is lively once again

266
00:33:57,000 --> 00:34:00,600
It's all thanks to the Three Stars...

267
00:34:00,600 --> 00:34:06,600
we've been enjoying harmony
and good harvests all this while

268
00:34:07,000 --> 00:34:11,000
Good.
I'm glad everybody is living in peace

269
00:34:13,000 --> 00:34:15,000
It's you, Your Highness!

270
00:34:15,000 --> 00:34:16,000
Magistrate Shi

271
00:34:18,000 --> 00:34:20,000
There's been no news of them

272
00:34:20,600 --> 00:34:23,600
-Did they contact you?
-No

273
00:34:28,600 --> 00:34:32,600
It's New Year, Auntie.
It's an auspicious occasion

274
00:34:33,000 --> 00:34:36,600
The moment I think of Fu,
I can't help...

275
00:34:37,000 --> 00:34:42,000
It's New Year. We should be happy.
Don't dwell on unhappy things

276
00:34:42,000 --> 00:34:44,000
Let's go and have our meals!

277
00:34:44,800 --> 00:34:46,800
It's New Year.
Cheer up

278
00:34:47,000 --> 00:34:48,000
I will

279
00:34:49,000 --> 00:34:53,000
Talk some sense into her,
Your Highness. She refuses to eat

280
00:34:55,000 --> 00:34:59,000
-What's the matter, Shuangxi?
-I'm all right

281
00:34:59,000 --> 00:35:01,000
Stop putting on a brave front

282
00:35:02,000 --> 00:35:08,000
Fu is to blame for the state she's in.
He just disappeared into thin air

283
00:35:08,000 --> 00:35:13,600
She pulls a long face all day
as a result

284
00:35:15,000 --> 00:35:18,600
If he comes back,
I'll chop him up into two

285
00:35:19,800 --> 00:35:23,800
Fuqi-ge must have been held up.
Otherwise, he'd come back for sure

286
00:35:25,000 --> 00:35:27,000
I'm washing my hands of you!

287
00:35:27,000 --> 00:35:31,000
This is to celebrate New Year and
the completion of the renovation work

288
00:35:31,000 --> 00:35:34,000
I wish everybody prosperity!

289
00:35:37,000 --> 00:35:38,000
Serve the dishes!

290
00:35:38,000 --> 00:35:39,000
Boundless Fortune!

291
00:35:40,000 --> 00:35:42,000
Exuberant prosperity!

292
00:35:43,000 --> 00:35:44,600
Affectionate longevity!

293
00:35:46,000 --> 00:35:50,600
This voice sounds like Shou's

294
00:36:16,000 --> 00:36:18,000
Why are you back all of a sudden?

295
00:36:18,000 --> 00:36:21,000
You were away for a year.
Mother missed you so much

296
00:36:25,000 --> 00:36:28,600
Tell us what happened, Fu!

297
00:36:29,000 --> 00:36:31,000
All right, I'll tell you everything

298
00:36:31,000 --> 00:36:36,600
After we succeeded in pleading for rain,
we went on to defeat the Deity of Plague

299
00:36:37,000 --> 00:36:39,000
The Jade Emperor was so pleased

300
00:36:40,000 --> 00:36:42,000
The Deity of Plague?
The Jade Emperor?

301
00:36:42,000 --> 00:36:45,000
In the nick of time...

302
00:36:45,000 --> 00:36:47,000
What's this about the Deity of Plague
and the Jade Emperor?

303
00:36:50,000 --> 00:36:55,000
Well, the Jade Emperor has ordered that
we continue to run the affairs...

304
00:36:55,000 --> 00:36:59,000
of the mortal world, so everybody can
enjoy fortune, prosperity and longevity

305
00:36:59,000 --> 00:37:03,600
Rest assured we'll do our job well

306
00:37:04,000 --> 00:37:08,000
Uncle, since you're an immortal,
do you have to go to Heaven?

307
00:37:09,000 --> 00:37:14,000
I've done many good deeds
for the people, you see

308
00:37:14,000 --> 00:37:19,800
So the Jade Emperor has granted us
a day's leave

309
00:37:19,800 --> 00:37:22,800
-Just one day?
-That's right

310
00:37:24,000 --> 00:37:26,000
So you're leaving again tomorrow?

311
00:37:26,000 --> 00:37:32,000
No. We still have to bring prosperity
and longevity to you in the coming year

312
00:37:36,000 --> 00:37:39,000
So you'll be leaving again next year?

313
00:37:39,000 --> 00:37:45,000
No... A day in Heaven is
a hundred years in the mortal world

314
00:37:45,000 --> 00:37:50,000
You have my word that we'll live in
bliss for the rest of our lives

315
00:37:51,000 --> 00:37:57,600
All of them are reunited. What about
you? Where's my daughter-in-law?

316
00:37:57,600 --> 00:37:59,600
Where's Ruyi?

317
00:38:01,000 --> 00:38:06,000
The Jade Emperor forbids me to see her
in Heaven. I haven't seen her

318
00:38:06,000 --> 00:38:11,600
Is she really missing?
Are you not going to get married?

319
00:38:12,000 --> 00:38:17,600
I don't know. I haven't been able to
locate her. I really miss her

320
00:38:18,000 --> 00:38:19,600
Help!

321
00:38:21,800 --> 00:38:22,800
Hold it there!

322
00:38:24,000 --> 00:38:25,000
Stop there!

323
00:38:25,000 --> 00:38:29,000
How dare you take liberties with women!
I must teach you a lesson!

324
00:38:29,000 --> 00:38:31,000
Ma Ruyi?!

325
00:38:33,800 --> 00:38:34,800
Shou!

326
00:38:38,000 --> 00:38:40,000
How did you get here?

327
00:38:40,000 --> 00:38:43,000
-Don't you want to see me?
-Of course I do

328
00:38:44,000 --> 00:38:48,000
I never dreamt that I'd be able
to see you again in the mortal world

329
00:38:48,000 --> 00:38:52,600
The Jade Emperor won't let us meet, but
the Queen Mother allows me to come down

330
00:38:53,000 --> 00:38:58,000
I'm also to make sure you
set a good example to the mortals,

331
00:38:58,000 --> 00:39:02,000
so they won't think they can count on
your blessings without working hard

332
00:39:04,000 --> 00:39:07,000
Great!
We'll never be separated again!

333
00:39:30,600 --> 00:39:32,600
Busy, Erlang?

334
00:39:32,600 --> 00:39:33,600
Hold it

335
00:39:38,000 --> 00:39:41,000
-What are you doing here?
-I came to drink with you

336
00:39:43,000 --> 00:39:47,600
Cut it out. Are you thinking of sneaking
a glance at the Celestial Mirror?

337
00:39:47,600 --> 00:39:51,000
I'm going to ask for leave of absence
to enjoy life in the mortal world

338
00:39:54,000 --> 00:39:57,000
Is the mortal world
such a wonderful place?

339
00:39:57,000 --> 00:40:00,000
See for yourself!

340
00:40:01,000 --> 00:40:08,000
Every household is living in peace
and enjoying prosperity and longevity

341
00:40:08,000 --> 00:40:11,600
It's all lively and thriving

342
00:40:12,000 --> 00:40:18,600
Look at this place.
It's cold and solitude

343
00:40:19,000 --> 00:40:23,000
Can't talk anymore. I'm going to ask for
leave to go down to the mortal world

344
00:40:23,000 --> 00:40:25,000
It's up to you to come with me

345
00:40:29,800 --> 00:40:30,800
Guolao!

346
00:40:31,000 --> 00:40:33,000
Guard the place

347
00:40:42,000 --> 00:40:44,000
I wish you boundless good fortune!

348
00:40:45,000 --> 00:40:48,600
I wish you a smooth advance
in officialdom!

349
00:40:49,000 --> 00:40:53,000
Great! And I wish all of you
longevity comparable to the mountains!

350
00:40:58,000 --> 00:41:00,000
Wait.
You've forgotten someone

351
00:41:07,000 --> 00:41:11,000
Ouyang Xiaotian? It's been
a long time. How have you been?

352
00:41:11,000 --> 00:41:15,000
I wish you a prosperous New Year

353
00:41:16,000 --> 00:41:19,000
A rare guest!
This adds on to our joy!

354
00:41:21,000 --> 00:41:25,600
We like to joke a lot.
Hope you don't mind

355
00:41:26,000 --> 00:41:30,000
It's New Year and everybody is
doing away with old stuff

356
00:41:31,000 --> 00:41:37,000
Why don't we take this opportunity
to bury the hatchet?

357
00:41:37,000 --> 00:41:39,000
Good idea!

358
00:41:39,000 --> 00:41:41,000
We'll welcome you

359
00:41:41,000 --> 00:41:43,000
Let's welcome Ouyang Xiaotian!

360
00:41:43,600 --> 00:41:45,600
Thanks for giving me this chance

361
00:41:45,600 --> 00:41:49,600
I've realized evil can never
prevail over good

362
00:41:50,000 --> 00:41:53,800
And I'm now able to
tell right from wrong

363
00:41:54,000 --> 00:42:00,000
Right. Harmony breeds wealth, and
a good deed will be returned by another

364
00:42:00,000 --> 00:42:03,000
Enjoy yourselves.
I'd better get back to work

365
00:42:04,000 --> 00:42:08,000
-Your Lordship, don't leave...
-I'm no longer a marquis

366
00:42:09,000 --> 00:42:12,600
Everybody has forgiven you

367
00:42:13,000 --> 00:42:15,000
Nobody is pursuing the matter

368
00:42:17,600 --> 00:42:19,600
Join us for the fun

369
00:42:26,000 --> 00:42:28,600
Don't forget us, Masters!

370
00:42:28,600 --> 00:42:30,600
So you've been hiding

371
00:42:31,000 --> 00:42:33,000
We're here to seek your forgiveness

372
00:42:33,000 --> 00:42:35,000
We won't do evil again

373
00:42:35,000 --> 00:42:37,000
That's right.
We promise

374
00:42:37,000 --> 00:42:39,000
We don't want to become ugly

375
00:42:40,000 --> 00:42:45,000
All right.
Go inside and work

376
00:42:46,000 --> 00:42:50,000
If anybody prays for fortune,
prosperity and longevity,

377
00:42:50,000 --> 00:42:52,000
you must grant him his wish

378
00:42:52,000 --> 00:42:55,000
-We still have to do that?
-That's right

379
00:42:56,000 --> 00:42:59,600
-But he must have a good heart
-Be kind

380
00:42:59,600 --> 00:43:04,000
And his wish must be a kind one.
Only then will it come true

381
00:43:04,000 --> 00:43:05,600
We've got it!

382
00:43:15,000 --> 00:43:21,600
Clean up everything or
I'll starve you for three days!

383
00:43:22,000 --> 00:43:28,600
Please don't bully me anymore.
I've mended my ways

384
00:43:31,000 --> 00:43:36,000
The crew of the Lucky Stars
wish everybody...

385
00:43:36,000 --> 00:43:39,600
a very prosperous New Year!

386
00:43:57,000 --> 00:43:59,000
Subtitled by S Lin


